            <p source="#source-69009-69200"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-27" source="#source-69009-69047">Ⅶ</g><seg source="#source-69047-69050">　</seg><seg source="#source-69053-69062">Drei Aufs</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-58" snh:source-marker="a:" source="#source-69062-69064" corresp="#source-69050-69053 #source-69195-69198">ä</hi><seg source="#source-69064-69068">tze </seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-81" snh:source-marker="u:" source="#source-69068-69070" corresp="#source-69050-69053 #source-69195-69198">ü</hi><seg source="#source-69070-69195">ber Spektren und Atombau. 2, Aufl., Mit 13 Abbildungen, VII u. 150S. Braunschweig, Verlag von Friedr. Vieweg u. Sohn, (1924).</seg></p>
            <p source="#source-69200-69414"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-28" source="#source-69200-69238">Ⅷ</g><seg source="#source-69238-69241">　</seg><seg source="#source-69244-69329">Atomteori og Naturbeskrivelse. 3 Artikler med en indledende Oversigt. Festskrift af K</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-73" snh:source-marker="o'" source="#source-69329-69331" corresp="#source-69241-69244 #source-69409-69412">ó</hi><seg source="#source-69331-69366">venhavns Universitet, Nov., 1929. K</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-73" snh:source-marker="o'" source="#source-69366-69368" corresp="#source-69241-69244 #source-69409-69412">ó</hi><seg source="#source-69368-69409">benhavn, Bianco Lunos Bogtrykkeri (1929).</seg></p>
            <p source="#source-69414-69603"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-29" source="#source-69414-69452">Ⅸ</g><seg source="#source-69452-69455">　</seg><seg source="#source-69458-69503">Atomtheorie und Naturebeschreibung. Vier Aufs</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-58" snh:source-marker="a:" source="#source-69503-69505" corresp="#source-69455-69458 #source-69598-69601">ä</hi><seg source="#source-69505-69532">tze mit einer einleitenden </seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-50" snh:source-marker="U:" source="#source-69532-69534" corresp="#source-69455-69458 #source-69598-69601">Ü</hi><seg source="#source-69534-69598">bersicht. IV u. 77S. Berlin, Verlag von Julius Springer, (1931).</seg></p>
